          "type": "text",
          "text": "I need to check that we haven't broken any types, especially with updateElement and our keyboard modifications. We're using elements in component scope, and I've added sr-only classes that rely on Tailwind's utility. This should work since their UI uses Tailwind."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "We've included aria-label and titles for buttons and improved the viewport's style with willChange. Now, I'm considering adding aria-label to interactive shapes and making elements more keyboard accessible by setting tabIndex={0}. It's important to ensure everything is focusable for keyboard users!"
        }
