      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I need to add an onKeyDown event for movement, but since movement is already handled by the parent container using selectedElementId, it seems manageable. For the CanvasElement, I'll include an onFocus handler to select the element."
        }
      ]
    },
